    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Candidate dataset: Long-range Vmem tumorigenesis article and supplementary materials";
    dc:description "contains separate voltage, HDAC1, antibiotic, and incidence interventions relevant to the proposed chain";
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.18632/oncotarget.1935>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2014-tumor-08--gpt--analysis-feasibility> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
